{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33914","headline":"襄州汉阳王故宅 · 皮日休","name":"襄州汉阳王故宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"碑字依稀庙已荒，犹闻耆旧忆贤王。\n园林一半爲他主，山水虚言是故乡。\n戟户野蒿生翠瓦，舞楼栖鸽污雕梁。\n柱天功业缘何事，不得终身似霍光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33914.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33914","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}